      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/9/4/9/1",
      "text": [
        ": سألت أبا جعفر عليه السلام عن قول الله عزوجل حُنَفَاءَ لِلَّهِ غَيْرَ مُشْرِكِينَ بِهِ فقلت: ما الحنيفية؟ قال: هي الفطرة"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.ammaar-muslim": [
          "1. [1/379] Ma’ani al-Akhbar: My father from Ali from his father from Ibn Abi Umayr from Ibn Udhayna from Zurara who said: I asked Aba Ja’far عليه السلام about the words of Allah Mighty and Majestic: “Hunafa for Allah, not associating with Him (anything)” <a href=\"/books/quran:22#h31\">[22:31]</a>. I said: What is the Hanifiyya? He said: The Fitra."
        ]
      }
